# PFAI Cursor Rules

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/memory/PROJECT_MEMORY.md` before substantial edits.
- Do not delete existing API routes, dashboard sections, or learning/security modules.
- Do not commit secrets, `.env`, or real API keys. Use env vars only.
- Continuous learning may curate/evaluate; never add silent auto-promote to production/active.
- Prefer Docker long-running hosting; do not force Vercel adaptations that break statefulness.
- After meaningful changes, update `docs/CHANGELOG_AGENT_CONTEXT.md` and relevant docs.
- Fix real failures; do not hide errors with mocks unless explicitly testing and labeled as such.
